			theme: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    theme - user interface display mode switcher

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">theme</span> [dark|light|toggle]

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Inspect or alter the active color system across the portfolio.`,

			sensors: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    sensors - silicon junction thermal and voltage probes

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">sensors</span> [OPTION]...

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
