        display thermal junction probes in degrees Fahrenheit instead of Celsius`,

			dmesg: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    dmesg - print or control the kernel ring buffer

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">dmesg</span> [OPTION]...

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Examine simulated silicon bringup and ATE automated test equipment ring buffer.

<span class="term-head">OPTIONS</span>
    <span class="term-cyan">-c, --clear</span>
        clear the ring buffer after printing contents
    <span class="term-cyan">-l, --level &lt;level&gt;</span>
        filter messages by level (err, warn, info)`,

			wafer: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    wafer - 300mm silicon wafer die sort map &amp; bin yield telemetry

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">wafer</span> [OPTION]...

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Render interactive ASCII die sort map for 300mm silicon wafer and compute bin defect yield.

<span class="term-head">OPTIONS</span>
    <span class="term-cyan">-s, --summary</span>
        display yield summary and bin breakdown without full wafer ASCII map`,

			cat: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    cat - concatenate and display file contents

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">cat</span> [FILE]...

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Output contents of simulated rootfs file to terminal standard output.

<span class="term-head">FILES</span>
    <span class="term-cyan">README.md</span>         Portfolio overview and engineering focus
    <span class="term-cyan">silicon_spec.json</span> 3nm FinFET silicon validation specs
    <span class="term-cyan">LICENSE</span>           MIT open source license
    <span class="term-cyan">brobOS.bin</span>        Statically linked binary executable header`,

			neofetch: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    neofetch - silicon validation bench specs and ASCII badge

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">neofetch</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Display silicon fabrication node, host specs, and color palette.`,

			about: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    about - hardware systems engineer background

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">about</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Print technical focus, career highlights, and verified profile links.`,

			skills: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    skills - core engineering competencies

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">skills</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Display competencies in Silicon Validation, Embedded Linux, and 3D Parametric CAD.`,

			projects: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    projects - featured hardware and 3D CAD showcase

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">projects</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Enumerate featured physical engineering designs and models.`,

			tests: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    tests - navigate to hardware and network test suites

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">tests</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Smooth scroll viewport to the live interactive hardware and network benchmark suites (#lab).`,

			network: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    network - Anycast edge throughput and latency test

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">network</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Navigate to the Anycast edge throughput benchmark with unloaded ping, jitter, and bufferbloat (#benchmark).`,

			mouse: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    mouse - mouse polling rate and switch debounce lab

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">mouse</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Navigate to the mouse polling oscilloscope, microswitch latency, and click counter lab (#input-lab).`,

			keyboard: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    keyboard - 104-key switch matrix and latency lab

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">keyboard</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Navigate to the 104-key switch matrix, rollover test, and actuation latency lab (#keyboard-lab).`,

			debug: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    debug - client hardware and edge telemetry inspector

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">debug</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Navigate to the ephemeral, zero-logging client hardware and Anycast edge telemetry inspector (#debug).`,

			visitor: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    visitor - query anonymous Cloudflare D1 visitor counter

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">visitor</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Query ephemeral visitor metric stored securely on Cloudflare D1.`,

			whoami: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    whoami - display current shell session and Anycast edge node

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">whoami</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
    Print authenticated user, terminal tty, and connected Cloudflare colocation airport code.`,

			uptime: `
<span class="term-head">NAME</span>
    uptime - show how long system has been running

<span class="term-head">SYNOPSIS</span>
    <span class="term-hl">uptime</span>

<span class="term-head">DESCRIPTION</span>
